# ============================================================
# PACKAGE MANAGER LOCK FILES
# ============================================================
# This project uses BUN as its package manager.
# bun.lock / bun.lockb are the CORRECT lock files and MUST be kept.
# All other package manager lock files are FORBIDDEN (competing lock files
# created by npm/yarn/pnpm when developers accidentally run wrong commands).
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Style backups
.style-backups/

# ============================================================
# FORBIDDEN BUILD TOOLS
# ============================================================
# Vite is STRICTLY FORBIDDEN in this project.
# This project uses Rsbuild as its frontend build tool.
# Any vite config or dependency must be rejected immediately.
vite.config.*
vitest.config.*
vite-env.d.ts

# ============================================================
# GO FILES - FRONTEND PROJECT BOUNDARY
# ============================================================
# This is a frontend (React/Rsbuild/Bun) project.
# The ONLY Go files allowed are embed.go and embed_dev.go,
# which exist solely to expose the compiled dist/ via Go's embed.FS
# to the backend. All other Go files (SPA handlers, server logic, etc.)
# MUST live in the backend Go project, NOT in this frontend submodule.
*.go
!embed.go
!embed_dev.go
